Algorithm 2 : BS(·)
Input: charger \(s_j\), charging group \(co_j\), residual unassigned rechargeable device set \(N'\)
1: low ← 0; high ← \(\frac{c(co_j \cup N') - c(co_j)}{|N'|}\); mid ← \(\frac{low + high}{2}\);
2: while (1) do
3:    F ← arg \(\min_{F' \subseteq N', F' \neq \emptyset} (c(co_j \cup F') - c(co_j) - mid|F')\);
4:    if \(|\frac{c(co_j \cup F) - c(co_j)}{|F|} - mid| \leq \varepsilon\) then
5:    return F;
6:    end
7:    if \(c(co_j \cup F) - c(co_j) - mid|F| \leq 0\) then
8:    high ← mid;
9:    else
10:    low ← mid;
11:    end
12:    mid ← \(\frac{low + high}{2}\);
13: end

